      "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Payment Receipt</title>\n  <style>\n     @page {\n      size: A4 potrait;\n      margin:0;\n     }\n\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\" font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 20px;\">\n  <div style=\" max-width: 800px; margin: auto; background-color: white; border-radius: 8px; padding-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\">\n    <div style=\"position: relative; text-align: center;\">\n      <!-- Image Element -->\n      <img src=\"https://dev.modlix.com/api/files/static/file/SYSTEM/cxapp/Receipts/top+backgroundImage.svg\" alt=\"Logo\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n      <!-- Circle Icon -->\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 40%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 90px; height: 90px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #08705C;\">\n          <img src=\"https://dev.modlix.com/api/files/static/file/SYSTEM/cxapp/Receipts/fincity+logo.svg\" alt=\"Logo\" style=\"width: 41px; height: 40px; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <h1 style=\"margin-top: 80px; font-size: 18px; color: #027d62;\">E-Payment Receipt</h1>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 14px; font-family: 'Inter'; color: #00000099; font-weight: 500;\">E-Receipt no. \n        <span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 14px; font-family: 'sans-serif'; color: #000000; font-weight: 700;\">${receiptNo}</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Details Table -->\n    <table style=\" border-collapse: separate; margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 60px; table-layout: auto;\">\n      <tr>\n        <th style=\"width:200px; padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; color: #00000066; font-size: 12px; line-height: 12px; font-weight: 500;\">BOOKING NAME</th>\n        <th style=\"width:200px; padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; color: #00000066; font-size: 12px; line-height: 12px; font-weight: 500;\">AMOUNT PAID</th>\n        <th style=\" width:200px;padding: 10px 0px 10px 0px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; color: #00000066; font-size: 12px; line-height: 12px; font-weight: 500;\">DATE PAID</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\" width:200px; padding: 0px 0px 10px 0px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">${bookingName}</td>\n        <td style=\" width:200px; padding: 0px 0px 10px 0px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\u20b9 ${totalAmountPaid}</td>\n        <td style=\"width:200px; padding: 0px 0px 10px 0px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">${date}</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <!-- Purchase Summary -->\n    <h2 style=\"color:#00000066; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:600; margin-left:60px;\">PURCHASE SUMMARY</h2>\n<div style=\"margin-right:60px; background-color:#F7F9FC; padding:20px 0px 20px 0px; margin-left:60px; border-radius:10px;\">\n  <table style=\"width:66vw; margin-left:42px; background-color:#F7F9FC; border-collapse:collapse;\">\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left;\">PROJECT</th>\n      <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px;\">AMOUNT INVESTED</th>\n      <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; border-right:none; padding-left:20px;\">No. of Sq Ft</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left;\">${projectName}</td>\n      <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px;\">\u20b9 ${amountInvested}</td>\n      <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; border-right:none; padding-left:20px;\">${area}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:40px; color:#00000099; font-size:12px; font-weight:400; font-family:sans-serif; line-height:12px; margin-left:60px;\">The below payment(s) have been made via the following modes:-</h2>\n<table style=\"margin-right:60px; margin-left:60px; margin-top:20px; background-color:#F7F9FC; border-collapse:collapse; border-radius:10px; width:76vw; padding:1px 0px 20px 0px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; width:20vw; text-align:left; padding-left:0px;\">MODE</th>\n    <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px;\">DATE</th>\n    <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px;\">BANK</th>\n    <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px; white-space:nowrap;\">TRANSACTION ID</th>\n    <th style=\"color:#00000099; font-size:12px; line-height:12px; font-weight:500; padding:10px; border-bottom:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px; border-right:none;\">AMOUNT INR</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:0px;\">${transactionDetails.paymentMethod}</td>\n    <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px;\">${transactionDetails.paidOn}</td>\n    <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px;\">\n      <img src=\"https://dev.modlix.com/api/files/static/file/SYSTEM/cxapp/Receipts/hdfc.svg\" alt=\"Bank Logo\" />\n    </td>\n    <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; border-right:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px;\">${transactionDetails.transactionId}</td>\n    <td style=\"color:#000000; font-size:14px; line-height:14px; font-weight:600; padding:10px; border-top:1px solid #ddd; text-align:left; padding-left:20px; border-right:none;\">\u20b9 ${transactionDetails.amountPaid}</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #555;\">\n    <p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">We hereby acknowledge and thank you for the above payments.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">The payment by cheque is subject to realization of the payment.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">Thanking You and assuring you of our best services at all times.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin-left: 60px;\">For \n      <span style=\"font-weight: 600; color: #000000;\">Apya Capital Services Private Limited</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin-top: 24px; margin-left: 60px; font-size: 12px; color: #00000066; line-height: 12px; font-weight: 600;\">NOTE:</p>\n  <!-- Notes -->\n  <div style=\"margin-left: 70px; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 11px; color: #888;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: 400;\">1. This is a System-generated receipt, doesn't require a signature.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: 400;\">2. In case of post-dated cheque, Kindly keep your account funded.</p>\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <!-- Footer -->\n   \n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "subject": "Recipts download"
    }
